      "label": "H1: Genuine environmental periodicity with ~3‑day lag affecting the two instruments differently",
      "probability": 0.25,
      "rationale": "A cyclic environmental factor (e.g., temperature swing, power‑grid loading) could influence the pendulum immediately and the resonator after a delay due to differing thermal or mechanical response times. The magnitude of the correlation is compatible with a real periodic driver, but the absence of similar lagged correlations in other instrument pairs makes this less likely.",
